{"seq":3,"slug":"per-market-compare","title":"分市场/语言对比看板","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/search-commerce-analytics/query-product-insights/per-market-compare","wordCount":2793,"readingTime":12,"html":"<h1 id=\"分市场-语言对比看板\">分市场/语言对比看板</h1><p>一张写着「各市场搜索 CTR」的柱状图，是跨境分析里最容易被误读的图表。德国 24%、印尼 31%、日本 17%、巴西 29%——看到这张图的人通常会得出「日本站的搜索体验最差、需要优化」的结论。同一批数据换一种切法可能是这样的：日本站的高 CTR 查询（品牌词、型号词）占比最低、探索类查询占比最高，而探索类查询的 CTR 天然只有导航类的一半。这里用的是查询意图分类的经典三分类——导航类（找特定站点/品牌）、信息类（找信息）、事务类（执行购买/下载等交互任务），由 Broder 于 2002 年提出（来源：Broder, &quot;A taxonomy of web search&quot;, ACM SIGIR Forum 36(2), 2002, <a href=\"https://sigir.org/files/forum/F2002/broder.pdf\">https://sigir.org/files/forum/F2002/broder.pdf</a>）。日本站没有任何问题，它只是流量构成不同。本文讲的就是如何构造一张<strong>真正可比</strong>的分市场看板。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-为什么跨市场数字不可直接比较\">核心概念：为什么跨市场数字不可直接比较</h2><p>不可比有三个层次的来源，必须分开处理，因为处理手段完全不同。</p>\n<p><strong>构成差异（composition）</strong>：各市场的查询意图构成、商品类目构成、设备构成、新老用户构成不同。这些差异影响指标的基线与方差，但不代表系统质量差异。处理手段是<strong>分层与标准化</strong>。</p>\n<p><strong>度量差异（measurement）</strong>：同一个指标在各市场用不同的口径采集。语言不同导致分词不同、影响召回率；客户端版本不同导致曝光判定阈值不同；时区不同导致日界不同。处理手段是<strong>口径统一与显式声明</strong>。</p>\n<p><strong>真实差异（causal）</strong>：系统在某个市场确实更差——商品池更小、本地化不完整、检索模型未针对该语言优化。这才是看板应该暴露的东西。处理手段是<strong>在消除前两层之后观察剩余差异</strong>。</p>\n<p>分析的难点在于：这三层在任何一张原始图上都是叠加的。所以一张可信的分市场看板必须按顺序做三件事——统一口径、标准化构成、然后再比较。跳过前两步直接比较，得到的差异几乎全是构成与度量差异，会让团队去修不存在的问题。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>层次</th>\n<th>典型来源</th>\n<th>是否应被看板暴露</th>\n<th>处理手段</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>构成差异</td>\n<td>意图构成、类目构成、设备、新老用户</td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td>分层 + 直接标准化</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>度量差异</td>\n<td>分词、曝光阈值、时区、客户端版本</td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td>口径统一 + 版本绑定</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>真实差异</td>\n<td>商品池、本地化质量、模型适配</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>剩余差异即为候选结论</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"直接标准化-把构成差异除掉\">直接标准化：把构成差异除掉</h2><p>标准化的目标是回答一个假想问题：<strong>如果所有市场的流量构成都一样，各市场的指标会是多少？</strong> 这是直接标准化（direct standardization）的标准用法：用一组统一的标准人口/流量权重去乘以各研究组的层内率，得到消除了构成差异的合成率（来源：Direct standardization / age-adjusted rates, CDC NCHS Statistical Notes, <a href=\"https://www.cdc.gov/nchs/data/statnt/statnt20.pdf\">https://www.cdc.gov/nchs/data/statnt/statnt20.pdf</a>）。</p>\n<p>设市场 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>m</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">m</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span></span></span></span></span> 在分层 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>s</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">s</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span></span></span></span></span> 上的指标为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>r</mi><mrow><mi>m</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>s</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r_{m,s}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7167em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">m</span><span class=\"mpunct mtight\">,</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，市场 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>m</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">m</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span></span></span></span></span> 在分层 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>s</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">s</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span></span></span></span></span> 上的流量占比为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>w</mi><mrow><mi>m</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>s</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">w_{m,s}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7167em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">m</span><span class=\"mpunct mtight\">,</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>。选取一个参照构成 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msubsup><mi>w</mi><mi>s</mi><mo>∗</mo></msubsup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">w^*_s</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9357em;vertical-align:-0.247em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6887em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.453em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mbin mtight\">∗</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.247em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>（通常取全球合计构成，或取主站的构成），标准化指标为：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msubsup><mi>r</mi><mi>m</mi><mtext>std</mtext></msubsup><mo>=</mo><munder><mo>∑</mo><mi>s</mi></munder><msubsup><mi>w</mi><mi>s</mi><mo>∗</mo></msubsup><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mi>r</mi><mrow><mi>m</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>s</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r_m^{\\text{std}} = \\sum_s w^*_s \\cdot r_{m,s}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1461em;vertical-align:-0.247em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8991em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.453em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">m</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">std</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.247em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.3em;vertical-align:-1.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.05em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.9em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.25em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7387em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.453em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mbin mtight\">∗</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.247em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7167em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">m</span><span class=\"mpunct mtight\">,</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>注意这里用的是<strong>各市场自己的分层内指标</strong> <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>r</mi><mrow><mi>m</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>s</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r_{m,s}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7167em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">m</span><span class=\"mpunct mtight\">,</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 和<strong>统一的权重</strong> <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex-error\" title=\"ParseError: KaTeX parse error: Expected group after &#x27;^&#x27; at position 2: w^̲__s\" style=\"color:#cc0000\">w^__s</span></span>。未标准化的原始指标是 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mo>∑</mo><mi>s</mi></msub><msub><mi>w</mi><mrow><mi>m</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>s</mi></mrow></msub><mi>r</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">_</mi><mrow><mi>m</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>s</mi></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\sum_s w_{m,s} r\\_{m,s}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.06em;vertical-align:-0.31em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.0017em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4003em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2997em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">m</span><span class=\"mpunct mtight\">,</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">_</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span></span></span></span></span></span>，两者差异完全来自权重。若某个市场在某个分层上没有流量（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>w</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">_</mi><mrow><mi>m</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>s</mi></mrow><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">w\\_{m,s}=0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7406em;vertical-align:-0.31em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"mord\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">_</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span></span></span></span></span>），则该市场的标准化值无法覆盖那个分层，必须在报表上标注覆盖率：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex-error\" title=\"ParseError: KaTeX parse error: Expected group after &#x27;^&#x27; at position 38: …: w\\_{m,s}&gt;0} w^̲__s\" style=\"color:#cc0000\">\\text{cov}_m = \\sum_{s: w\\_{m,s}&gt;0} w^__s</span></span>。覆盖率低于 80% 的市场不应参与排名，因为它的标准化值是基于缺失的分层算的。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"WITH strata AS (&#10;  SELECT&#10;    market,&#10;    intent_type,               -- 导航/品牌/类目/属性/探索&#10;    device,                    -- ios/android/web&#10;    user_tenure,               -- 新/老&#10;    SUM(impressions)  AS imp,&#10;    SUM(clicks)       AS clk&#10;  FROM search_daily_strata&#10;  WHERE dt BETWEEN :start AND :end&#10;  GROUP BY 1,2,3,4&#10;),&#10;weights AS (&#10;  SELECT intent_type, device, user_tenure,&#10;         SUM(imp) * 1.0 / SUM(SUM(imp)) OVER () AS w_star&#10;  FROM strata GROUP BY 1,2,3&#10;)&#10;SELECT&#10;  s.market,&#10;  SUM(w.w_star * (s.clk * 1.0 / NULLIF(s.imp,0)))       AS ctr_std,&#10;  SUM(CASE WHEN s.imp &gt; 0 THEN w.w_star ELSE 0 END)     AS coverage,&#10;  SUM(s.clk) * 1.0 / NULLIF(SUM(s.imp),0)               AS ctr_raw&#10;FROM strata s JOIN weights w USING (intent_type, device, user_tenure)&#10;GROUP BY s.market&#10;ORDER BY ctr_std DESC;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WITH</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> strata </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  SELECT</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    market,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    intent_type,               </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 导航/品牌/类目/属性/探索</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    device,                    </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- ios/android/web</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    user_tenure,               </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 新/老</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    SUM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(impressions)  </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> imp,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    SUM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(clicks)       </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> clk</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> search_daily_strata</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> dt </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">BETWEEN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> :</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">start</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> AND</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> :</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">end</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  GROUP BY</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">3</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">4</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">weights </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> intent_type, device, user_tenure,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">         SUM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(imp) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> /</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> SUM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">SUM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(imp)) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">OVER</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> () </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> w_star</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> strata </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">GROUP BY</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">3</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SELECT</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  s</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">market</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  SUM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">w</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">w_star</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> *</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">s</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">clk</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> *</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> /</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> NULLIF</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">s</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">imp</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)))       </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ctr_std,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  SUM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CASE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> WHEN</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> s</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">imp</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> ></span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> THEN</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> w</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">w_star</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> ELSE</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> END</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)     </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> coverage,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  SUM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">s</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">clk</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> /</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> NULLIF</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">SUM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">s</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">imp</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">),</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)               </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ctr_raw</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> strata s </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">JOIN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> weights w </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">USING</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (intent_type, device, user_tenure)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">GROUP BY</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> s</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">market</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">ORDER BY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ctr_std </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">DESC</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span></code></pre></div><p>这段查询同时产出 <code>ctr_raw</code> 与 <code>ctr_std</code>，两者的差就是构成差异的贡献。实践中这个差常常超过真实差异——这正是它必须被算出来的原因。</p>\n<p><strong>分层维度的选择</strong>要满足两个条件：每个分层在多数市场都有足够流量，且分层对指标的解释力显著。意图类型、设备、新老用户通常满足；而像「邮编」「具体机型」这类高基数维度不适合做标准化，它们会让每个格子里只有几十次曝光（高基数问题的分析侧形态见 <a href=\"../event-pipeline/sampling-cardinality\">采样、基数与成本控制</a>）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"语言维度的特殊性\">语言维度的特殊性</h2><p>市场与语言不是一一对应的，而语言对搜索指标的影响比对任何其他指标都直接。三个必须显式处理的问题。</p>\n<p><strong>同一市场多种语言。</strong> 加拿大（英语/法语）、瑞士（德/法/意）、印度（英语/印地语/泰米尔语等）、比利时（荷/法）。按市场聚合会把两种语言的检索质量差异抹掉；按语言聚合又会跨市场混合商品池差异。正确做法是<strong>双维度交叉</strong>：看板的基础格子是 <code>market × locale</code>，市场级数字由格子汇总而来，且汇总时必须保留「语言构成」作为可下钻的第二层。</p>\n<p><strong>同一语言多个市场。</strong> 西班牙语覆盖西班牙与拉美多国，葡萄牙语覆盖葡萄牙与巴西，阿拉伯语覆盖海湾与北非。这些市场的商品池、定价、物流完全不同，但语言相同意味着可以用相同的分词与同义词资源。分析上的价值是：同一语言不同市场的检索指标差异，<strong>排除了语言处理能力这个变量</strong>，因此更可能是商品池或本地化问题。这是一个很有用的对照设计。</p>\n<p><strong>低资源语言的处理能力差异必须先量化。</strong> 分词错误率、同义词覆盖率、拼写纠正准确率在英语与泰语之间可以差一个量级。如果看板里泰语站的 CTR 低，在归因给「商品池」之前必须先量化「语言处理能力」的贡献。可行做法是构造一组<strong>平行查询集</strong>：把同一批商品在多个语言下的等价查询（人工或翻译产出）作为探针，测量各语言下这些查询的召回率与首条命中率。这个探针集是少数几个能把「语言处理能力」从「商品池」里分离出来的工具。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>语言情形</th>\n<th>例子</th>\n<th>分析设计</th>\n<th>可比性</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>一市场多语言</td>\n<td>加拿大、瑞士、印度</td>\n<td>market × locale 交叉格</td>\n<td>需按 locale 分层</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>一语言多市场</td>\n<td>西语（ES/MX/AR）、葡语（PT/BR）</td>\n<td>同语言跨市场对照</td>\n<td>语言变量被控制</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>低资源语言</td>\n<td>泰语、越南语、印尼语</td>\n<td>平行查询探针集</td>\n<td>需先量化语言能力</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>双向文字</td>\n<td>阿拉伯语、希伯来语</td>\n<td>注意展示与解析差异</td>\n<td>解析层单独验证</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"看板结构-从总览到下钻的四层\">看板结构：从总览到下钻的四层</h2><p>一个能支撑决策的分市场看板应当有固定的下钻路径，让读者在遇到异常时能一路走到可执行结论。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    L1[第一层 全球总览 各市场标准化指标] --&gt; L2[第二层 市场内分解 意图×设备×新老]&#10;    L2 --&gt; L3[第三层 类目与查询簇下钻]&#10;    L3 --&gt; L4[第四层 商品与供给下钻]&#10;    L1 --&gt; W1{标准化与原始差异大吗}&#10;    W1 --&gt;|大| W2[构成差异为主 不下结论]&#10;    W1 --&gt;|小| W3[进入真实差异排查]&#10;    W3 --&gt; L2\">graph TD\n    L1[第一层 全球总览 各市场标准化指标] --&gt; L2[第二层 市场内分解 意图×设备×新老]\n    L2 --&gt; L3[第三层 类目与查询簇下钻]\n    L3 --&gt; L4[第四层 商品与供给下钻]\n    L1 --&gt; W1{标准化与原始差异大吗}\n    W1 --&gt;|大| W2[构成差异为主 不下结论]\n    W1 --&gt;|小| W3[进入真实差异排查]\n    W3 --&gt; L2</pre><p><strong>第一层全球总览</strong>：每个市场一行，同时给 <code>ctr_raw</code>、<code>ctr_std</code>、<code>cvr_std</code>、零结果率、退出率，以及覆盖率。读者第一眼看的是标准化值与原始值的差，而不是标准化值本身——差大就说明这个市场的表现主要由流量构成决定，不宜下结论。</p>\n<p><strong>第二层市场内分解</strong>：进入某个市场后按意图 × 设备 × 新老拆开，找出该市场内部哪些分层显著偏离该分层的全球基线。这一步会把「日本站探索类查询多」这类构成事实自动暴露出来。</p>\n<p><strong>第三层类目与查询簇下钻</strong>：在具体分层内按类目或需求簇看，找出异常集中的位置。到这一层，结论开始接近可执行——「日本站探索类查询中家居类目的召回率显著低于全球」是一个可以派单的说法。</p>\n<p><strong>第四层商品与供给下钻</strong>：进入具体商品，转 <a href=\"product-performance\">商品搜索表现与可售诊断</a> 的诊断序列。这一步的关键是确认异常是「本地商品池不足」还是「有货但召回/排序没做好」。</p>\n<p>四层之间的每一层都必须携带样本量。一个只有 300 次曝光的市场分层格，其 CTR 的置信区间宽到无法与基线区分，任何结论都是噪声。</p>\n<h2 id=\"跨市场对比的四个常见错误\">跨市场对比的四个常见错误</h2><p><strong>错误一：用全球平均值作基线。</strong> 全球平均是被大市场主导的，用它做基线会让小市场系统性显得异常。正确基线是<strong>同分层</strong>的全球值，或取一组结构相似的市场做参照组。</p>\n<p><strong>错误二：忽视汇率与期间。</strong> 用 GMV 做分母的指标（如每千次搜索的 GMV）在跨市场比较时必须换算成同一货币，且换算应用<strong>期末汇率</strong>还是<strong>期间平均汇率</strong>会带来可观测差异。这条口径必须与财务口径一致，并在看板上标注。</p>\n<p><strong>错误三：把时区导致的日界差异当异常。</strong> 一个市场按当地时间分日、另一个按 UTC 分日，会让大促当天的指标在跨市场对比时错位一天。做法是全局统一按 UTC+8 或按市场当地时间但在报表上标注，两种都可以，混用不行。</p>\n<p><strong>错误四：把「市场小」当「数据少所以随便看」。</strong> 小市场的方差大，噪音多，因此更应该用更长的观察窗口（周而非日）和更强的平滑。对小市场用与大市场相同的告警灵敏度，结果是每天告警、无人处理、最终所有告警被忽略。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>跨市场数字不可比有三层原因：构成差异、度量差异、真实差异；必须按「统一口径 → 标准化构成 → 比较剩余」的顺序处理。</li>\n<li>直接标准化用统一的参照权重 <code>w*</code> 与各市场自己的分层内指标相乘求和；必须报告覆盖率，覆盖率低的市场不参与排名。</li>\n<li>语言维度要交叉而非替代：一市场多语言按 <code>market × locale</code> 交叉；一语言多市场是控制语言变量的天然对照；低资源语言需先用平行查询探针集量化处理能力。</li>\n<li>看板固定四层下钻：总览 → 市场内分层 → 类目与查询簇 → 商品与供给；每层携带样本量。</li>\n<li>四个常见错误：全球平均作基线、忽视汇率期间、时区日界混用、对小市场用大市场的告警灵敏度。</li>\n</ul>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[原始市场指标] --&gt; B[口径统一 曝光阈值/时区/汇率]&#10;    B --&gt; C[分层 意图×设备×新老×locale]&#10;    C --&gt; D[直接标准化 参照权重w*]&#10;    D --&gt; E{覆盖率≥80%}&#10;    E --&gt;|否| E1[不排名 标注数据不足]&#10;    E --&gt;|是| F[标准化指标排名]&#10;    F --&gt; G{标准化与原始差异}&#10;    G --&gt;|大| G1[构成差异为主]&#10;    G --&gt;|小| G2[真实差异 进入下钻]&#10;    G2 --&gt; H[类目与查询簇]&#10;    H --&gt; I[商品与供给]\">graph TD\n    A[原始市场指标] --&gt; B[口径统一 曝光阈值/时区/汇率]\n    B --&gt; C[分层 意图×设备×新老×locale]\n    C --&gt; D[直接标准化 参照权重w*]\n    D --&gt; E{覆盖率≥80%}\n    E --&gt;|否| E1[不排名 标注数据不足]\n    E --&gt;|是| F[标准化指标排名]\n    F --&gt; G{标准化与原始差异}\n    G --&gt;|大| G1[构成差异为主]\n    G --&gt;|小| G2[真实差异 进入下钻]\n    G2 --&gt; H[类目与查询簇]\n    H --&gt; I[商品与供给]</pre>","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"分市场/语言对比看板","id":"分市场-语言对比看板"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：为什么跨市场数字不可直接比较","id":"核心概念-为什么跨市场数字不可直接比较"},{"level":2,"text":"直接标准化：把构成差异除掉","id":"直接标准化-把构成差异除掉"},{"level":2,"text":"语言维度的特殊性","id":"语言维度的特殊性"},{"level":2,"text":"看板结构：从总览到下钻的四层","id":"看板结构-从总览到下钻的四层"},{"level":2,"text":"跨市场对比的四个常见错误","id":"跨市场对比的四个常见错误"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"商品搜索表现与可售诊断","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/search-commerce-analytics/query-product-insights/product-performance"},"next":{"title":"搜索曝光/点击事件 schema","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/search-commerce-analytics/event-pipeline/search-event-schema"}}